    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`cronNode3` is a local cron node module under `cronServer`."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this node for node-scoped local cron configuration and activation. Server-wide behavior belongs in `cronServer`, and cron capability logic belongs in reusable modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Node settings should remain explicit, observable, and safe to rebalance across sibling nodes."
    }
  ],
